{"id":"n22085-1-8","stage":3,"title":"올라서다 · 登上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22085-1-8-1","ko":"담 위에 올라서지 마. 위험해.","zh":"不要站在墙顶上，很危险的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담","meaning":"围墙","explanation":"담：围墙","readings":[{"term":"담","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28390","senseId":"1","lemma":"담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"올라서지","meaning":"登上，爬上","explanation":"올라서다：登上，爬上；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"올라서다","audio":"/audio/4188e44688f0634016e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22085","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라서지","audio":"/audio/728cfa5e906c6c5b0236.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}},{"text":"위험해.","meaning":"危险","explanation":"위험하다：危险；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"위험하다","audio":"/audio/b5bc2bdd91e111ed65a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69909","senseId":"1","lemma":"위험하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위험해","audio":"/audio/b4ff4803c0e5f1c4982d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3f34a6ccae998972","term":"담","zh":"围墙","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3","entryId":"28390","definition":"为了挡住房子或一定空